* 
* Rap command file
* For barge aft part
*
new/append model 
filename Wigley.igs
all mappings
read file
heal model
HEAL:plot grid lines on boundaries (3D) toggle 1 
set view:0 -0.0701956 -0.10702 0 2.01283 0.642788 -0.383022 0.663414 0.766044 0.321394 -0.55667 -1.0631e-16 0.866025 0.5
#pause
close
*
* Build the connectivity and a global triangulation
*
topology
merge tolerance 0.0009
split tolerance factor 0.001
maximum area 0.00001
deltaS 0.001
build edge curves 
merge edge curves    
* the connectivity is determined
#pause
*
* triangulate
*
triangulate
* global triangulation
#pause
exit
*
* Save the  hull
*
save model
Wigley_rap_out.hdf
* model has been saved
exit
